  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: the fallback is now profile.py:3530, text unchanged. The shared right-anchored helper exists (ir.symbol_path_slot, d1116cc1af): on dart:dart:io:0-0:module:module it returns dart:io vs bare split dart. Sibling ir._extract_path_slot is fixed. The same bare split also parses the dst at profile.py:3519-3523 (imported_module = parts[1]). MECHANISM: symbol-id path slot parsed left-anchored with split(':')[1] instead of ir.symbol_path_slot."  # 5714
